  "post_content": "<p>Anoche comenzaron las fiestas del barrio Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; i adjacents, que se desarrollar&aacute;n hasta el pr&oacute;ximo domingo, 10 de junio. Ayer viernes hubo porrat, cena de j&oacute;venes y disfraces, y hoy ya habr&aacute; toros por la tarde y por la noche.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8721.jpg\" alt=\"img_8721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8722.jpg\" alt=\"img_8722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8723.jpg\" alt=\"img_8723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8724.jpg\" alt=\"img_8724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8725.jpg\" alt=\"img_8725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8726.jpg\" alt=\"img_8726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8727.jpg\" alt=\"img_8727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8728.jpg\" alt=\"img_8728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesbarricastello/img_8729.jpg\" alt=\"img_8729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestesb